Chainvara co-signer and recovery tool
Copyright (c) 2026 Chainvara. All rights reserved.

You may download, install and run these files, unmodified, to operate your own Chainvara organization (co-signing
its transfers, holding and backing up its key shares, and recovering its keys). You may read and audit them.

You may not redistribute modified copies, or present a modified copy as the Chainvara co-signer.

THE FILES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. You are responsible for backing up the key shares the
co-signer holds: a lost share means the funds of that wallet are lost.
